      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ki'taambo cha kwiswanania",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la ati', “U'lu' muntu' ali'fumya ki'taambo cha kwiswanania, nawe ali'fumya ng'ombe, yi'v'e ngosya ninga nki'ma, yi'lamudime afumye i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwa ng'ombe yeni'yo, na ku'yi'si'nzi'la bi'hi' na wingi'li'lo wa Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Haho v'ahozya, v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'a ki'gosya, v'alali'nyanyagi'le ihozezyo magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho cha kwiswanania, alafumye kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu: lu'sasa lose na maguta ago gali' mu nda, ga ng'ombe yeni'yo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nfigo iv'i'li' haki'mo na maguta gazyo, ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li', na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni, v'alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo, haki'mo na ako kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'taambo cha ku'zigya i'cho ki'li' ha igu'lya na nkwi i'zyo zili'v'aka moto. Kenako kali' kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'mutogezya Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
