          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aho muntu' alav'e ali'mufumi'zya Gu'ku' Mulungu ki'taambo cha kwiswanania cha nkolo ninga mbu'li, yi'v'e ngosya ninga nki'ma, yi'lamudime afumye i'yo yi'li' wu'du'hu' wu'lema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' muntu' afumye nkolo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo kakwe, haho alakafumye ha mbele yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alatu'u'le mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na mutwe gwayo, nawe alayi'si'nze ha mbele ya Ihema lya Ku'sangi'zya. Hangi' v'ana v'amwa Aloni v'alanyanyagi'le magazi gayo ku' ki'la lwandi' lwa ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' ku'fuma ku' ki'taambo cheni'cho cha kwiswanania, alamufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu maguta gayo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ku'zigya: muki'la gwayo u'go gu'puti'lilwe bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' haki'mo na maguta gago, lu'sasa lose na maguta gose ago gali' mu nda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'liwa ka ku'zigya ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
