          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nfigo iv'i'li' na maguta gazyo ago gali' bi'hi' na muki'mbi'li' na lwandi' lu'soga lwa iti'ma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe muhozya alavizigye ha igu'lya na ihozezyo ku'v'a kalu'mbi'lo ka ki'liwa ka ku'zigya ako kali' na wu'motu wa ku'togezya. Maguta gose ga ki'taambo gali' gamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhayo gwenu'gu' gu'ku'v'a nhama ya nhananhana ku' wu'v'yalwa winywe u'wo wu'lalonde, mu wikalo winywe wose, ku'v'a mukasye mulye ninga hado maguta ga ndimu ninga nyama ya magazi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.17",
